---
title: SmartSchools End-to-End Learning Loop
config:
  theme: neutral
  flowchart:
    curve: basis
---
flowchart TD
  setup[Configure organisation, campuses, academic year, classes and enrolments]
  upload[Upload curriculum and approved school resources]
  extract[Parse candidate topics, concepts, objectives and prerequisites]
  review{Authorized educator approves curriculum version?}
  revise[Review and correct extracted structure]
  publish[Publish version with source provenance]
  teach[Prepare lesson and topic-linked assessment]
  submit[Student submits answers and evidence]
  mark[Teacher reviews marks and approves official grade]
  evidence[Persist topic-level assessment evidence]
  model[Update mastery estimate and prerequisite gaps]
  actions[Create next-best learning actions]
  student[Student receives practice, guided tutor support and quests]
  teacher[Teacher receives class heatmap and reviewable intervention flags]
  parent[Authorized guardian sees progress and support guidance]
  project[Recommend curriculum-linked STEM project]
  portfolio[Student adds project evidence to portfolio]
  reassess[New practice and project evidence]

  setup --> upload --> extract --> review
  review -->|No| revise --> extract
  review -->|Yes| publish --> teach --> submit --> mark --> evidence --> model --> actions
  actions --> student
  actions --> teacher
  actions --> parent
  actions --> project --> portfolio --> reassess
  student --> reassess
  reassess --> evidence

  guard[Human approval gates official curriculum and grades<br/>AI guidance is explainable, reviewable and revisable]
  guard -. constrains .-> review
  guard -. constrains .-> mark
  guard -. constrains .-> actions
